---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { plugins } from "../../data/plugins";
---
<Layout title="Plugin registry — Torana" description="Curated Torana plugins and their requested capability classes.">
  <section class="frame prose" style="max-width:var(--page)">
    <p class="eyebrow">Registry v1 · curated</p>
    <h1 class="display">Install behavior, not a starter pack.</h1>
    <p>Official plugins are installed individually. Each release bundle carries a manifest, schema, source link, license, and SHA-256 digest. Capabilities are approved against that digest and reviewed again when an update changes permissions or failure behavior.</p>
    <div class="catalog">
      {plugins.map((plugin) => (
        <article class="plugin">
          <h3>torana/{plugin.name}</h3>
          <p>{plugin.description}</p>
          <span class="tag">{plugin.kind}</span>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <h2>Registry API</h2>
    <pre><code>GET https://torana.sh/registry/v1/index.json</code></pre>
    <p>The registry is intentionally curated for v1. Local-file installation remains available for your own plugins and development builds.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
